Architecture App V1 Launch Plan (Revised)                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                     
 Executive Summary                                                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                                                     
 Goal: In 2-3 weeks, create a demo-ready app with flawless scanning, compelling building content, smooth compass-based walk experience, and a guided 
  tour mode.                                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                     
 Key Insight from User: The compass-based dérive experience is INTENTIONAL - it's about being activated, not having a map. Hot/cold proximity,       
 mystery, exploration. The gamification (quests, XP, etc.) helps the algorithm learn preferences and creates retention - simplify but don't cut.     
                                                                                                                                                     
 What Actually Needs Work:                                                                                                                           
 1. Scanning reliability - 35% failure rate from timeouts, GPS issues                                                                                
 2. Building info content - "Lore" placeholder, thin context, RAG failures                                                                           
 3. Walk experience polish - hot/cold feedback, compass UX, arrival detection                                                                        
 4. Guided tour mode - doesn't exist yet (Brooklyn Bridge style)                                                                                     
 5. Gamification simplification - too complex/confusing, needs streamlining                                                                          
                                                                                                                                                     
 ---                                                                                                                                                 
 Priority 1: Scanning Reliability (Days 1-5)                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                     
 Current Problems                                                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                                     
 - CLIP backend cold-start timeouts (30s timeout, needs 25s+) - 15% failures                                                                         
 - GPS reverse geocode wrong in dense areas - 10% failures                                                                                           
 - Promise.race() logic is broken (line 445-448) - sequential not parallel                                                                           
 - BIN format mismatch (.0 suffix) - 7% failures                                                                                                     
 - No offline fallback                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                     
 Fixes                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                     
 1.1 GPS Grid Pre-Cache (Days 1-2)                                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                                                     
 Create: src/services/gpsGridCacheService.ts                                                                                                         
 - On app startup, fetch buildings in 200m grid around user                                                                                          
 - For walks, pre-cache route buildings at start                                                                                                     
 - Impact: 95% of scans instant (0ms vs 5-30s)                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                                     
 1.2 Fix Promise.race() (Day 2)                                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                                                     
 File: src/screens/Scan/ScanScreen.js lines 445-448                                                                                                  
 - Make GPS and CLIP truly parallel                                                                                                                  
 - First success wins, don't wait for both                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                     
 1.3 CLIP Timeout + Retry (Day 3)                                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                                     
 File: src/services/buildingVerificationService.ts                                                                                                   
 - Increase timeout 30s → 45s                                                                                                                        
 - Add 3x retry with exponential backoff                                                                                                             
 - Impact: 65% → 85% CLIP success                                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                                     
 1.4 Address Normalization (Day 4)                                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                                                     
 Create: src/utils/addressNormalizer.ts                                                                                                              
 - "165A Main St" → "165", "Main St"                                                                                                                 
 - Avenue ↔ Ave, Street ↔ St variations                                                                                                              
 - Fuzzy match with Levenshtein                                                                                                                      
 - Impact: 70% → 90% address matching                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                     
 1.5 Tour Building Lookup (Day 5)                                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                                     
 Create: src/data/tourBuildingLookup.ts                                                                                                              
 - Hard-code locations for tour buildings                                                                                                            
 - GPS proximity only in tour mode (no CLIP needed)                                                                                                  
 - Impact: 99%+ scan success in tours                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                     
 Target: 95%+ overall scan success, 99%+ in tour mode                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                     
 ---                                                                                                                                                 
