 Priority 3: Walk Experience Polish (Days 10-13)                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                                     
 Design Philosophy (Confirmed with User)                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                     
 - Compass-based dérive is INTENTIONAL                                                                                                               
 - No full map - mystery and activation                                                                                                              
 - Hot/cold proximity feedback                                                                                                                       
 - BUT: Need clear, live-updating directions like Google Maps                                                                                        
 - AND: Mini radar/circle map (video game style) for spatial awareness                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                     
 Current Issues                                                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                                                     
 - Hot/cold feedback could be more engaging                                                                                                          
 - Turn-by-turn only shows first instruction, doesn't update                                                                                         
 - Arrival detection has no geofence                                                                                                                 
 - DirectionalGlow exists but could be more prominent                                                                                                
 - Easy to get lost without better guidance                                                                                                          
                                                                                                                                                     
 Fixes                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                     
 3.1 Live Turn-by-Turn Directions (Day 10)                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                     
 File: src/screens/Walk/WalkNavScreen.js lines 440-498                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                     
 Make directions feel like Google Maps (without the map):                                                                                            
 - Show next 2-3 steps, not just first instruction                                                                                                   
 - Live updates based on current location                                                                                                            
 - Clear formatting:                                                                                                                                 
 ↑ Head north on Centre St (320 ft)                                                                                                                  
 ↰ In 150 ft, turn left onto Chambers St                                                                                                             
 ⬤ Then: Woolworth Building on your right                                                                                                            
 - Recalculate if user deviates from route                                                                                                           
 - Voice/haptic optional "turn now" alerts                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                     
 3.2 Mini Radar Map (Day 11)                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                     
 Create: src/components/walk/RadarMiniMap.tsx                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                     
 Video game style HUD element:                                                                                                                       
 - Small circular radar (corner of screen)                                                                                                           
 - Red dot = target building direction                                                                                                               
 - Your heading indicator (like a compass rose)                                                                                                      
 - Faint dots for other nearby buildings                                                                                                             
 - Pulses when you're close                                                                                                                          
 - NOT a street map, just spatial orientation                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                     
 This bridges the gap between "no map" and "totally lost."                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                     
 3.3 Enhanced Hot/Cold + Geofence (Day 12)                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                     
 Files: src/screens/Walk/WalkNavScreen.js, src/components/glow/DirectionalGlow.tsx                                                                   
                                                                                                                                                     
 Proximity feedback:                                                                                                                                 
 - Color gradient: cold (blue) → warm (orange) → hot (red)                                                                                           
 - Haptic pulses increase as you approach                                                                                                            
 - "Getting warmer..." / "You're close!" text hints                                                                                                  
 - Radar dot grows larger as you approach                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                     
 Geofence auto-prompt (30m):                                                                                                                         
 - Auto-show "You've arrived! Scan to verify"                                                                                                        
 - Strong haptic                                                                                                                                     
 - DirectionalGlow at max intensity                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                     
 3.4 Walk Flow Polish (Day 13)                                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                                     
 - Progress indicator (3/8 buildings)                                                                                                                
 - XP earned visible during walk                                                                                                                     
 - Smooth animations between buildings                                                                                                               
 - "Skip" confirmation if skipping multiple                                                                                                          
                                                                                                                                                     
 Target: Navigate confidently without a full map, feel activated not lost                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                     
