 Priority 6: Simple User Contributions (Integrated Throughout)                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                                     
 Why Keep This                                                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                                     
 - Accelerates data acquisition without you finding everything                                                                                       
 - User engagement (they become invested in growing the database)                                                                                    
 - Diverse photo angles improve CLIP training                                                                                                        
 - Community-driven growth                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                     
 Implementation: Photo + Location Only (Zero Friction)                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                     
 File: src/screens/Scan/NotFoundScreen.js (already partially exists)                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                     
 When building not found:                                                                                                                            
 1. User taps "Add this building"                                                                                                                    
 2. Camera opens                                                                                                                                     
 3. Take photo (GPS auto-captured)                                                                                                                   
 4. "Thanks! We'll add details soon."                                                                                                                
 5. Done - no forms, no friction                                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                                     
 Backend:                                                                                                                                            
 - Auto-approve if GPS matches known building footprint                                                                                              
 - Queue for manual review otherwise                                                                                                                 
 - You batch-review weekly                                                                                                                           
 - Show "Pending" status to contributor                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                     
